}

QDialog#QtSoftwareKeyboardDialog QPushButton#button_ok,
QDialog#QtSoftwareKeyboardDialog QPushButton#button_ok_shift,
QDialog#QtSoftwareKeyboardDialog QPushButton#button_ok_num {
