QDialog#QtSoftwareKeyboardDialog QWidget#arrow_left,
QDialog#QtSoftwareKeyboardDialog QWidget#arrow_left_shift,
QDialog#QtSoftwareKeyboardDialog QWidget#arrow_left_num {
